 22 40009100 F: +91 22 40009101 www.npci.org.in CIN: U74990MH2008NPL189067 contact@npci.org.in\", \"needs_priority_review\": false, \"section_heading\": \"Document opening\", \"retrieval_reason\": \"direct_match\", \"roles\": [], \"source_corrections\": null, \"product_memberships\": [\"UPI\"], \"metadata_quality\": \"existing_source_metadata\", \"source_coverage\": {\"total_pages\": 2, \"empty_pages\": [], \"thin_pages\": [], \"page_count_verified\": true, \"origin\": \"existing_v04\"}}\n{\"citation\": \"S5\", \"document_id\": \"2024-OC-207\", \"title\": \"Auto- replenishment of NETC FASTag and RuPay NCMC with UPI AutoPay\", \"circular_number\": \"207\", \"page\": 1, \"issue_date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": \"a) To include auto-replenishment of NETC FASTag and RuPay NCMC, as and when the balance falls below a threshold set by the customer, under the e- mandate framework.\", \"needs_priority_review\": false, \"section_heading\": \"Document opening\", \"retrieval_reason\": \"direct_match\", \"roles\": [], \"source_corrections\": null, \"product_memberships\": [\"UPI\"], \"metadata_quality\": \"existing_source_metadata\", \"source_coverage\": {\"total_pages\": 2, \"empty_pages\": [], \"thin_pages\": [], \"page_count_verified\": true, \"origin\": \"existing_v04\"}}\n{\"citation\": \"S6\", \"document_id\": \"2024-OC-207\", \"title\": \"Auto- replenishment of NETC FASTag and RuPay NCMC with UPI AutoPay\", \"circular_number\": \"207\", \"page\": 1, \"issue_date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": \"2. Further, it was directed:\", \"needs_priority_review\": false, \"section_heading\": \"Document opening\", \"retrieval_reason\": \"direct_match\", \"roles\": [], \"source_corrections\": null, \"product_memberships\": [\"UPI\"], \"metadata_quality\": \"existing_source_metadata\", \"source_coverage\": {\"total_pages\": 2, \"empty_pages\": [], \"thin_pages\": [], \"page_count_verified\": true, \"origin\": \"existing_v04\"}}\n{\"citation\": \"S7\", \"document_id\": \"2024-OC-207\", \"title\": \"Auto- replenishment of NETC FASTag and RuPay NCMC with UPI AutoPay\", \"circular_number\": \"207\", \"page\": 1, \"issue_date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": \"1. Reserve Bank of India (RBI) has announced to facilitate e-mandate framework for auto-replenishment of balances in NETC FASTag and RuPay National Common Mobility Card (NCMC) in “Statement on Developmental and Regulatory Policies” dated 07\\\" June 2024.\", \"needs_priority_review\": false, \"section_heading\": \"Document opening\", \"retrieval_reason\": \"direct_match\", \"roles\": [], \"source_corrections\": null, \"product_memberships\": [\"UPI\"], \"metadata_quality\": \"existing_source_metadata\", \"source_coverage\": {\"total_pages\": 2, \"empty_pages\": [], \"thin_pages\": [], \"page_count_verified\": true, \"origin\": \"existing_v04\"}}",
